Quintu-OS is an unofficial fan project, not affiliated with or endorsed by
NumWorks, nor with the authors or publishers of "The Quintessential
Quintuplets" (Go-Toubun no Hanayome). The five sisters are original fan-art
portraits drawn with simple shapes (apps/home/quint/gen_icons.py in the
patch): no image from the manga or the anime is used. The icons, logo and
pictures are original drawings.
